From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 06:32:19 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 143/147] hjviewer: review fixes, style3 lane (1.9)

UX-K3: the phone's camera view (mobile/pages/view_camera_page.dart) wraps its build in
hjvFixedTextScale as the remote screen does, so the camera's picture and its bottom bar stay at
100 % text (design T5: the remote screens at 1.0).

UX-S3: HJViewer lines outside the hjv_*/hjviewer_* files take the type scale's roles in place of
raw sizes: hjvPeersPlaceholder's second line is HjvText.caption, the desktop left pane's
blocked-ID line and install card text are HjvText.bodySmall. The peer search field keeps its raw
13 (an input's text against a fixed cursor height).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 flutter/lib/common/widgets/peers_view.dart       | 3 +--
 flutter/lib/desktop/pages/desktop_home_page.dart | 7 +++----
 flutter/lib/mobile/pages/view_camera_page.dart   | 7 +++++--
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

